OL,3,GNEWSAManchester's Make a Difference
OL,4,AAwards winners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mountain rescue volunteer, a "hero"
OL,7,Ffundraiser and a "lifesaving"
OL,8,Fbereavement group are among the winners
OL,9,Fof BBC Radio Manchester's Make a
OL,10,FDifference Awards 2026.
OL,12,FThe winners were celebrated at a
OL,13,Fceremony held at Leigh Sports Village
OL,14,Fon Thursday, where their inspiring
OL,15,Fstories of kindness, resilience and
OL,16,Fdedication were recognised.
