OL,3,GNEWSAManchester's Make a Difference
OL,4,AAwards winners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award-winners were announced in
OL,7,Feight categories that recognised people
OL,8,Fwho go above and beyond to help others
OL,9,Fand make a real difference in the
OL,10,Fcommunity and were presented by BBC
OL,11,FRadio Manchester's Joe McGrath.
OL,13,FThe Make a Difference Awards were set
OL,14,Fup across the country to give the
OL,15,Fpublic the chance to say thank you to
OL,16,Fthose who go the extra mile b@/to make
OL,17,Flife better for others in their local
OL,18,Fcommunities.
